    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-8">
        Principal Engineer specializing in real-time systems and functional architecture.
      </p>

      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
        [Your bio content will go here - 200-300 words about your professional background,
        expertise, and what drives your work]
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-12 mb-6">Technical Expertise</h2>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-700">
        <li>Real-time distributed systems</li>
        <li>Functional programming patterns</li>
        <li>System architecture and design</li>
        <li>[Add your key areas]</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-12 mb-6">Career Highlights</h2>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-700">
        <li>[Highlight 1]</li>
        <li>[Highlight 2]</li>
        <li>[Highlight 3]</li>
      </ul>
